{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1000_p", "source_sha256": "17a833a8663b81e311d53ba3e107b98a0609e12361ed36ac92c13b8059461b1d", "ja": "美奈子、お疲れ様。\n新しい衣装はどうだ？", "zh": "美奈子，辛苦了。\n新衣服怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "f8c96f7fcd7391a7c4b8b12066d5ba7036f5e511b67cfa9c54bab350dbb426f6", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\n私、とっても気に入っちゃいました♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，您辛苦了！\n我特别特别喜欢呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "be72009b0c81277cd42954e6eb8356bf7387690a51f2be263bc6f6b8bebe15ac", "ja": "今回は、この衣装のデザインを検討してる\nところから見学させてもらったんですけど……。", "zh": "这次，我还从讨论这套服装的设计开始，就一直在旁边观摩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "9a9e95d2a47e86e774c926d8cebab110b3321dcd206f9c51305a313ee2469cbd", "ja": "私、ずっと隣で見てただけなのに。なんだか\nいつも以上に衣装に愛着が湧いちゃって……。", "zh": "我只是一直在旁边看着而已，却不知为何比平时更加喜欢上这套衣装了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1004_p", "source_sha256": "915ddc2294e43b0120841d6831a37256645bf7000198416b6af2304b152c4f6d", "ja": "美奈子の新曲に合わせた衣装だからな。\n作るまでの経緯も見てもらえて、良かったよ。", "zh": "毕竟这是配合美奈子新歌设计的服装嘛。能让你看到制作过程，我也觉得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "c39d757eb9f728513ff94c9f14d6a063753033ea97e0c81d744ab7dbac857d5a", "ja": "はい！　美咲さんが作業するところも\n見学してましたけど、すごかったです！", "zh": "是的！我还参观了美咲小姐制作的过程，真的很厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "384d67c4dd20f51ddcfb904a32bcc8d9d33d9a2d5c8a46c175e11053a9a3cf62", "ja": "ミシンで縫う作業も大変ですけど、\n縫う前の準備も、丁寧で細やかですよね。", "zh": "用缝纫机缝制的工作虽然也很辛苦，但缝制前的准备工作也同样细致周到呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "a929558d94637d766f113d907389b6103a4db076db6a31d5667dc49919714d7f", "ja": "デザインを起こして、型紙を用意して、\nイメージにあう布やボタンを選んで……。", "zh": "先设计好样式，准备纸样，再挑选符合构想的布料和纽扣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "119e485671db39a6245f9123341178e93d3a0d915ccbd8e17f171a482372585f", "ja": "これってなんだか、料理にも似てませんか？", "zh": "这和做菜是不是有点像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b2cda0c7ecc3d68cd3e59ec7a32ba53fc26b89a04bffedebd319159e6d2dd39d", "ja": "衣装作りと料理の共通点か……。\n言われてみれば、似てるところがあるかもな。", "zh": "制作衣装和做料理的共同点……\n这么一说，好像确实有相似之处。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "e29d7e95141bd473dc1cb67ae797f7c2a0e44acf9cc29d9a23fc4921ad996e33", "ja": "ステージに立つのは私ですけど、衣装や\n曲を作る人や、{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "虽然站上舞台的是我，但还有制作服装和歌曲的人，以及{$P$}先生……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "6bc6e6b227ae997b01d6e1cca59e92dfdfbc1be56e38968eca5e5460bc1f69e1", "ja": "いろんな人のお仕事があって、\nアイドルのステージが完成するんですよね？", "zh": "正是因为有许许多多人的工作，偶像的舞台才能完成，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "e7e2c1a81a7de8dd1174be6d50f9b7657c0f9dc827dfadbe870615a94b2bbb55", "ja": "そう考えると、アイドルのステージって\nいろんな料理が集まったフルコースみたいですね♪", "zh": "这样想的话，偶像的舞台就像是汇聚了各种料理的全套餐呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1013_p", "source_sha256": "7830f370a6276354bfb7fc55139a1006ef740d9aa061a0221f6dd27a783fc31e", "ja": "フルコースか……。確かに、ライブが終わった後の\n満足度は、フルコース以上かもしれないな！", "zh": "全套餐啊……这么一想，演唱会结束后的满足感，确实可能比全套餐还要高！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "9782ee80f1413e813a6d3b9e2ede815e8798153144b4cf96a936c40fa2bbef69", "ja": "本当ですか？　{$P$}さん。\nそんなに褒めると、本気にしちゃいますよ！", "zh": "真的吗？{$P$}先生。\n您这么夸我，我可要当真了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "d9c67766882c6810f9f11373b26776505a151138cc588c33940a7caa9442de44", "ja": "でも、みんなで心をこめて作るステージですから。\nもっとたくさんの人に、知ってほしいなぁ……。", "zh": "不过，这可是大家一起用心打造的舞台。真希望能让更多的人知道啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6be54c8430b974099af5f01fc285860ec27c3b8fd93927bb5c6fab3b6ba11c64", "ja": "そうだな。まずは劇場のお客さんにだけど……いつか\n世界中の人に、美奈子のフルコースを振る舞おう！", "zh": "是啊。首先是剧场里的客人，不过……总有一天，\n要为全世界的人献上美奈子的全套餐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "4a5f8736efb8ca82a833ff568ec8d36fd23200f8c6bd2ca50d2678832ad7a693", "ja": "せ、世界の人にですか！？\nなんだか、すごくスケールの大きな話ですけど……。", "zh": "是、是要给全世界的人吗！？\n总觉得，这话题的规模也太大了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "3a35f99234f683b95eab0187c90cad7a61c377d1fc09d6dc98dc0c4e96b009ee", "ja": "でも、なんだか腕が鳴ります！\n世界中にお届けするために、がんばらなくちゃ！", "zh": "不过，总觉得干劲十足呢！\n为了把美味传递给全世界，我可得加油了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "348f666ccbe53d34144cfd5941129b8325974499dbda0fafe18d479235732ffc", "ja": "そのためにも、練習が必要ですよね！\nまずは、チャーハンの限界に挑戦します！", "zh": "为此，也需要练习才行呢！\n首先，就来挑战炒饭的极限吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0284_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2860d75197b60493c4138fd6b47be0c91b62eb33ac03bd8fd2063676b5124feb", "ja": "えっ？　いつから普通の料理の話に……！？\nちょっと待ってくれ、美奈子……おーい？", "zh": "诶？什么时候开始聊起普通料理了……！？\n等一下，美奈子……喂——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
